'''Nguluwan''' is a [[mixed language]] spoken on [[Ngulu Atoll]] located between [[Yap]] and [[Palau]]. The grammar and lexicon are [[Yapese language|Yapese]], but the [[phonology]] has been affected by [[Ulithian language|Ulithian]]. This language is endangered as it only has 50 speakers and that its speakers are shifting to [[Ulithian language|Ulithian]].

